This project is a port of gvzdv/claudish-to-english
(https://github.com/gvzdv/claudish-to-english), a Claude Code plugin that
rewrites assistant messages into plain English using a local ollama model.

The rewrite prompt is taken from that project, adapted only where the domain
differs (assistant messages become pull request descriptions). Original work
copyright (c) its respective authors.

The attribution previously lived in LICENSE, which prevented GitHub from
detecting the licence as MIT. It lives here instead so the licence file stays
byte-identical to the canonical MIT text.
